+    /*
+     * Sped up / slowed + reverb. Speed moves the pitch with it (both
+     * PlaybackParameters values), the way those edits sound. Reverb is an
+     * EnvironmentalReverb on the output mix fed through an aux send, so the
+     * dry signal stays as it is and the send level is the amount. Devices
